        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Custom 30\" Offset Laguna 150 Teak Pull, First Impressions</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCustom Laguna 150 Door Pull, 1-1/2\" solid round teak wood grip at 30\" overall length.  Inside offset with bevel mounts at 24\" center to center in stainless steel with a powder coat matte black finish.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Lewis 01 Teak Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Teak</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application.  Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
